  "notes": [
    "Desktop availability and renderer drivers are build/runtime dependent.",
    "SIR1 compute generates backend compute-shader source for GLSL 4.50, HLSL 5, MSL 2 and WGSL; GLSL 1.20 is fragment-only.",
    "The portable compute reference executor is deterministic CPU conformance logic, not a claim of physical GPU execution.",
    "Physical GPU and physical gamepad qualification remain external hardware evidence.",
    "0.33.0 carries this API surface forward unchanged while adding the native object/incremental build backend.",
    "0.34.0 carries this hosted API surface forward unchanged while adding Native Aggregate ABI and managed-heap/GC preview support.",
